25,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The late-turn pool is dangerously thin, but the lift maintenance contract actually has spare capacity.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"The old accessibility work was mixed; lifts did well, but lane-priority failed. Also, a late-evening pilot actually worked.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Pre-war shells are risky due to unrecorded voids. Also, ferry and rail back offices can't agree on data terms.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The capital ledger has a ring-fenced construction balance, but the technology line was trimmed.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Mid-city runs are slower now, but crowds clear at the same rate. Most delays are actually waiting for connections.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Takumi, if the late-evening pilot worked, do we have the staff to repeat it now?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"I only know it worked then, not if we have the people now.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, you mentioned the late-turn pool is thin. That sounds like a problem for night services.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,The ticketing fees are... very high. They exceed the paving budget.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, does that mean a new fare system would save money?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"Yes, Toshio. Overtime is already covering everything. A night extension would be a struggle.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"If lane-priority failed before, we should be careful with bus corridors.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Toshio,,And the data disagreement makes an integrated fare platform look like a bureaucratic nightmare.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'm not sure... but the construction balance is there for something.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"If the delays are in the connections, maybe station upgrades help more than new buses?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,4,talk,Victoria,,The lift maintenance capacity is a strong point for station work.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,4,talk,Takumi,,I agree. It's safer than repeating the lane-priority mistakes.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"Station work is risky because of the shells, but it avoids the data disputes.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I just don't want us to commit to costs we can't sustain.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,4,talk,Sakura,,Let's see the options!,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
